            "review_title": "Review at Tour With Loco Guide",
            "review_text": "Venture48082338460\n1 contribution\n0\nLovely food tour and enjoyable\nMay 2025 • Couples\nAt first i thought this is the local restaurant but this is food tour service, but well done we have travel around Ho Chi Minh City and enjoy such a great food with the tour guide, Dragon is so lovely and he has a huge knowledge about the culture in here.\nVery enjoyable\nInsider tip:\nTravel by Scooter ( get yourself ready for that )\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 22, 2025",
